, payment processors and pharmacy chains. this site is built to add as little to that pile as possible. here's a plain-language overview of what gets stored, why, and how to nuke it."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted","children":"no google. no meta. no amazon. no analytics platform. no ads. the only third-party we ever talk to is discord, and only because that's how login works."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ereb-box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ereb-section-title","children":"// if you're just browsing"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 px-6 py-5 font-mix text-[11px] normal-case tracking-normal text-text leading-relaxed prose [&_strong]:text-fg","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"we keep some basic usage information so we can tell what's working and what's broken — things like which pages are hit and rough device/browser info. it's collected on our own servers, never sold, never shared, and never linked to anything identifying."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["we ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"obey do-not-track signals"}],". if your browser sends ",["$","code",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"DNT: 1"}],", the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://globalprivacycontrol.org/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Global Privacy Control"}]," ","header, or you're running an analytics-blocking extension (ublock origin, privacy badger, etc.), we collect nothing for that session. no fingerprinting, no rough-location logging, no analytics cookies."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ereb-box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ereb-section-title","children":"// cloudflare"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3 px-6 py-5 font-mix text-[11px] normal-case tracking-normal text-text leading-relaxed prose [&_strong]:text-fg","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["we sit behind ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"cloudflare"}]," as a CDN / reverse proxy. that means every request to diyhrt.coffee passes through their network before reaching us — TLS terminates at their edge, they cache static assets, and they handle a chunk of the bot / DDoS protection layer."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"two things cloudflare injects automatically that we cannot strip server-side:"}],"$L5","$L6"]}]]}],"$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}],null,"$Lf"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$L10",false]],"S":false}
5:["$","ul",null,{"className":"ml-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-text/90 marker:text-pink","children":[["$","li","a small bot-detection script loaded from /cdn-cgi/... on each page. it's first-party from your browser's point of view (same origin as the rest of the site) and used to distinguish humans from automated traffic. cloudflare's own privacy policy covers what they do with it.",{"children":"a small bot-detection script loaded from /cdn-cgi/... on each page. it's first-party from your browser's point of view (same origin as the rest of the site) and used to distinguish humans from automated traffic. cloudflare's own privacy policy covers what they do with it."}],["$","li","an HTTP-level Network Error Logging header that asks browsers to report FAILED requests (only failures, not successful loads) to cloudflare so they can spot regional outages.",{"children":"an HTTP-level Network Error Logging header that asks browsers to report FAILED requests (only failures, not successful loads) to cloudflare so they can spot regional outages."}]]}]
